  "description": "<h3><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">商品説明</span></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">🌟 「ポチッと5秒で、手元からポカポカ。」 🌟</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">可愛くて便利な 電子カイロ が登場！</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">5秒で即暖：寒い冬でもすぐに手元が温まる。</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">コンパクトで可愛いデザイン：ポケットやバッグにすっぽり収まり、持ち運びラクラク！</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">繰り返し使えるエコ設計：充電式で経済的＆環境にやさしい。</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">ギフトにも最適：冬のプレゼントやお出かけにぴったりのアイテムです。</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">冬の外出、通勤・通学、アウトドアやレジャーに大活躍！</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">「手のひらサイズの温もり」を、ぜひ体験してください。</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">アフィリエイトパートナー募集！</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">この可愛い電子カイロを一緒に広めてくれるアフィリエイターを募集しています。</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">報酬：販売価格の20％</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">あなたの紹介で売れた分だけ、しっかり報酬が受け取れます！</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">高機能で実用的な商品なので、冬シーズンに売れやすい！</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SNSやブログ、YouTubeで紹介しやすいデザインと機能性。</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">季節のギフト需要も狙える商品です。</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">今すぐ登録して、冬の温もりをシェアしませんか？</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">あなたの紹介でたくさんの人に笑顔と温かさを届けましょう！</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span></p>\r\n<h3><strong>Product Description</strong></h3>\r\n<p>🌟 <strong>\"Warmth in 5 seconds, right at your fingertips.\"</strong> 🌟</p>\r\n<p>Introducing the <strong>cute and convenient electronic hand warmer</strong>!</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Instant warmth in 5 seconds</strong>: Keep your hands cozy, even on the coldest days.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Compact and adorable design</strong>: Fits perfectly in your pocket or bag for easy carrying.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Eco-friendly and reusable</strong>: Rechargeable for long-term use, saving money and the planet.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Perfect for gifting</strong>: A thoughtful winter gift for loved ones or yourself.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Ideal for commuting, outdoor activities, or simply staying warm on the go.<br>Experience \"palm-sized warmth\" like never before!</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Affiliate Partners Wanted!</strong></h3>\r\n<p>We are looking for affiliate partners to help spread the warmth with this adorable electronic hand warmer.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Commission: 20% of the sales price</strong><br>Earn generous rewards for every sale made through your referrals!</li>\r\n<li><strong>High-demand winter product</strong>: Easy to sell during the cold season.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Perfect for social media, blogs, and videos</strong>: Stylish design and practical functionality make it easy to promote.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Great for seasonal gifting</strong>: Taps into holiday and winter gift-buying trends.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Sign up now and share the warmth this winter!</strong><br>Let&rsquo;s bring smiles and cozy comfort to as many people as possible.</p>",
